{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic horror and the VHS generation of movie rentals. Creatures of the Night aims to be an immersive and fun experience putting players inside some horror classics that can be played solo or multiplayer </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Co-operative online multiplayer for 1-4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unique monsters with their own AI and mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mazes to navigate while evading traps, curses and creatures of the night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Search for clues while fighting for your life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- VOIP integration, speak to other players with your microphone, but be careful!, some creatures may hear you!.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2562910?t=1741796929","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741796929","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562910/a320d35ee649c59cb11ab614bc535c16dc2773b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741796929","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562910/a320d35ee649c59cb11ab614bc535c16dc2773b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741796929","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic horror and the VHS generation of movie rentals. Creatures of the Night aims to be an immersive and fun experience putting players inside some horror classics that can be played solo or multiplayer </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Co-operative online multiplayer for 1-4 play